{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00779","headline":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆平 · 赵光逢、张衮","name":"郊庙歌辞 梁郊祀乐章 庆平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天命降鉴，帝德惟馨。\n享祀不忒，礼容孔明。\n奠璧布币，荐神献精。\n神佑以答，敷锡永宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵光逢、张衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}